-| Type       | Description                                     | Resolution priority                      |
-| ---------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |
-| `BUNDLE`   | Worker bundle (user code)                       | From bundle: Bundle → Builtin → Fallback |
-| `BUILTIN`  | Runtime modules (`node:*`, `cloudflare:*`)      | From builtin: Builtin → Internal         |
